# BALANCE Master Plan — Full Task Checklist

> **Navigation Architecture Note (2026-03-18):** The app now uses a Hub-and-Tab architecture.
> All individual admin/manager/employee pages are accessed via Hub pages with `?tab=` deep-linking.
> Legacy routes redirect automatically. Hub routes:
> - `/leave-hub` — Leave & Holidays (summary, request, history, calendar)
> - `/identity-hub` — Identity & Security (profile, biometrics)
> - `/manager/hub` — Manager Hub (approvals, team-calendar, team-attendance, delegation)
> - `/admin/system` — System Administration (policies, sites, attendance-config, biometrics, shifts, rosters)
> - `/admin/hr-operations` — HR Operations (directory, departments, balances, attendance, analytics, audits, trust-review)

